        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"5c34c25a-b5ca-4127-9287-14a2880f4e07\",\"review_text\":\"Won't let me get Student discount. Messaged Sheer they did not reapond.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c06049f9-4df9-4f97-9878-5225f50225d5\",\"review_text\":\"Why is the free working is so so stupied\"},{\"review_id\":\"ea6bcd4b-fa16-4ac4-a129-59d990c3f9ad\",\"review_text\":\"Nice app (⁠◔⁠‿⁠◔⁠)\"},{\"review_id\":\"4c5b3913-5fd1-4ef3-9674-d845ad1eea1c\",\"review_text\":\"It is good and helpful app\"},{\"review_id\":\"d028c830-b08d-4e81-be02-12da5275aef3\",\"review_text\":\"Just great. Recommended songs algorithms need improving though.\"},{\"review_id\":\"266369d8-3594-46ba-a2bd-5bf0bcd756ac\",\"review_text\":\"Ban Spotify for support sweaden\"},{\"review_id\":\"2167ddf5-01f9-463b-b1db-61b3ac5d6a16\",\"review_text\":\"Where ever I go if it goes to school to showering I can always listen to the song podcast and more!\"},{\"review_id\":\"d1229a28-20a5-4cfb-95e9-6af464f41559\",\"review_text\":\"Very easy to set up and navigate. Super easy to build play list. Even for an old man like me. By\"},{\"review_id\":\"5d4afe7c-5bb4-4f4e-acd0-8337d907d5c9\",\"review_text\":\"If I was to choose between Pandora and Spotify it's Spotify more variety of music 🎵\"},{\"review_id\":\"7ecedb28-efd9-4735-acca-9519482af8d2\",\"review_text\":\"Thanks for finally adding the scroll bar back. Enjoy your correct rating now. Remove it again and you're dropping again. K love you bye\"}]}"
